        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವಜಾ ಮಾಡು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಜಾ ಮಾಡು — vajā māḍu — \"to dismiss; to sack\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತಡವಾಗಿ ಬರುತ್ತಿದ್ದ ನೌಕರನನ್ನು ಕಂಪನಿ ವಜಾ ಮಾಡಿತು. taḍavāgi baruttidda naukaranannu kampani vajā māḍitu. The company sacked the employee who kept coming late."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ವಜಾ ಮಾಡಿದೆ, vajā māḍide."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also of a court case: ಅರ್ಜಿ ವಜಾ ಆಯಿತು, the petition was dismissed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಜಾ ಮಾಡು (vajā māḍu) joins vajā, a word that came into Kannada through the language of offices and courts, with ಮಾಡು, \"to do\"; the earlier source of vajā is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
